---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Equine-Assisted Therapy in North Idaho | MWRS"
  description="Equine-assisted therapy in Oldtown, Idaho, offering experiential, hands-on counseling with horses. A calm setting for teens, adults, and families who connect best through movement, interaction, and nontraditional therapeutic environments."
>
  <main class="equine-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="subpage-hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h1>Equine-Assisted Therapy</h1>
        <p>
          MWRS offers equine-assisted therapy in Oldtown, Idaho, providing a calm,
          experiential setting where clients work with horses alongside a trained
          therapist. This approach can be especially helpful for clients who
          struggle with PTSD, teens who struggle with office settings, or those
          who connect more easily through hands-on experience.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-outline btn-outline--counseling">
          Ask about Oldtown equine sessions
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Body -->
    <section class="equine-body">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Why equine therapy helps</h2>
        <p>
          Working with horses allows clients to practice boundaries,
          communication, emotional regulation, and confidence in a non-judgmental
          environment. Horses respond to body language and energy, offering
          immediate, honest feedback that can be difficult to access in
          traditional talk therapy.
        </p>

        <h3>Equine therapy may be a good fit if you:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Feel stuck in traditional talk therapy</li>
          <li>Prefer experiential or hands-on learning</li>
          <li>Are working through trauma, trust, or boundary issues</li>
          <li>Have a teen who struggles to open up in an office setting</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Sessions take place mostly outdoors depending on the season. Our
          intake team can help you decide whether this approach is the right
          fit for you or your child.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="equine-cta">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Interested in equine therapy?</h2>
        <p>
          Share a bit about what you're looking for, and our team will help you
          explore whether equine-assisted therapy is the right setting for your
          goals.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-outline btn-outline--counseling">
          Ask about Oldtown equine sessions
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <style>
    .equine-page {
      background: #f9fafb;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .subpage-hero {
      padding: 10rem 1.5rem 3rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.webp");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .subpage-hero h1 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .subpage-hero p {
      margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Shared section wrapper ───────────────────────── */
    .section-inner {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ── Body ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .equine-body {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.2rem;
      background-color: #e5e9f3;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.webp");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .equine-body h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .equine-body h3 {
      margin: 1.1rem 0 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .equine-body p {
      margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .equine-body ul {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .equine-body li + li {
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    /* ── CTA ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .equine-cta {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.webp");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .equine-cta h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .equine-cta p {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.6rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Outline button ───────────────────────────────── */
    .btn-outline {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease,
        box-shadow 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-outline--counseling {
      border-color: #7d6fb3;
      color: #7d6fb3;
    }

    .btn-outline--counseling:hover {
      background: #7d6fb3;
      color: #ffffff;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(125, 111, 179, 0.3);
    }
  </style>
</Layout>